      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Trace Parser (sde:analyze)\nparse traces + GLM-5.1 review per failed run\n1–3 of 5 valid, failures model → ACCEPTED\n0 or 4–5 → revision on revise queue (v<8)\nv8 out of band → REJECTED (exhausted)\ntimeout / infra → retry slot, never a 0",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "genloop_856846b530b745dc",
